      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The beast I'd have you fell is the Cockatrice — a\r\nmonster lurking in the Divine Blossom Terrace.",
        "Jp" : "退治してほしい魔物は、《神花のテラス》にいる\r\n魔獣、コカトリスさ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286266,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "A gargantuan monster that bears the head of a\r\ncock, with a petrifying breath— quite the\r\ntroublesome foe. 'Twas too\r\nmuch for Ringdeel alone.",
        "Jp" : "石化の吐息を吐く、巨大な雄鶏――\r\nかなり厄介な魔物だよ\r\nリングディール一人じゃ手に余っていたんだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286267,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Thanks to that beast, we could not investigate the\r\nruins — had no choice but to seal them off. But I\r\nthought you might be the one to fell it.",
        "Jp" : "そいつのせいで、あの遺跡を調べられず\r\nやむなく封鎖していたんだけど\r\n君たちなら倒せるんじゃないかと思ってね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286268,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I'm counting on you, ser.",
        "Jp" : "どうかよろしく頼むよ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286269,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
