      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "You felled the Cockatrice in the Divine Blossom\r\nTerrace! Its death cry echoed all the way hence!",
        "Jp" : "《神花のテラス》のコカトリスを\r\n倒してくれたんだね！\r\nここまで魔獣の断末魔が響いたよ"
