      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Thanks to you, I'll be able to\r\ninvestigate those ruins.\r\nI am truly beholden to you.",
        "Jp" : "お陰であの遺跡について調べられそうだ\r\n感謝するよ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286271,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Truth be told, somewhere in the ruins may lie\r\nanother cause of the elves' extinction —\r\nsomething called the \"White Scourge\". The bane of\r\nErte Deenan, oft spoken of in\r\nthe historical records.",
        "Jp" : "実はね、遺跡のどこかにはエルフが滅んだ\r\nもう一つの原因――\"白い災厄\"と呼ばれる何かが\r\nあるかもしれないんだ\r\n文献に度々登場する、エルテ・ディナンの災いさ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286272,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "'Tis said the elves' extinction was the\r\nalchemists' doing, but 'twould seem there's more\r\nto it. I needs must uncover the true\r\nnature of that scourge.",
        "Jp" : "エルフが滅んだ原因は錬金術師のせいだと\r\n言われているけど、どうもそれだけじゃないらしい\r\n僕はどうしてもその災いの正体を確かめたいんだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286273,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "If I learn aught, I'll let you know.",
        "Jp" : "何か分かったら君にも伝えるよ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286274,
